{
  "title": "VM Ops -- Cardinality & Performance",
  "uid": "vm-ops",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 7,
  "editable": true,
  "tags": [
    "victoriametrics",
    "self-monitoring"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 1000,
      "title": "What this dashboard shows",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Audience: SRE / Platform.** All metrics are scraped from VictoriaMetrics' own `/metrics` endpoint by vmagent. If panels stay empty after 60s, run `make diagnose` -- it likely means vmagent isn't scraping `victoriametrics:8428` (check `prometheus.yml`)."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Cardinality",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 100
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Estimated active series",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "vm-llm-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "description": "Best-effort from vm_cache_entries. The exact 'active series' value lives at /api/v1/status/tsdb.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ]
        },
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum(vm_cache_entries{type=~\".*hour_metric_ids.*|.*active.*\"})) or sum(vm_cache_entries) or vector(0)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Samples ingested / s",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "vm-llm-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "rps"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "samples/s",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(vm_rows_inserted_total[1m]))) or vector(0)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "New series created / s (churn)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "vm-llm-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 15,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "new series/s",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(vm_new_timeseries_created_total[5m]))) or (sum(rate(vm_new_timeseries_created[5m]))) or vector(0)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Storage & RAM",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 200
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disk usage (data parts)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "vm-llm-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "decbytes"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "data on disk",
          "expr": "sum(vm_data_size_bytes)"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Total disk used by VM data + index files (sum across types)."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Process RSS memory (all VM components)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "vm-llm-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "decbytes"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "expr": "(process_resident_memory_bytes{job=~\"victoriametrics|vmagent|vmalert\"}) or process_resident_memory_bytes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Query performance",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "id": 300
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Average query duration (sum/count)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "vm-llm-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "description": "Mean query duration via vm_request_duration_seconds_sum / _count. VM uses internal vmrange-style buckets so direct histogram_quantile on _bucket doesn't work.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.7
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.95
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "Wait 30s for first scrape -- queries to VM populate this fast."
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "expr": "sum(rate(vm_request_duration_seconds_sum[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(vm_request_duration_seconds_count[5m])), 0.001)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Active goroutines (concurrency proxy)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "vm-llm-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 18
      },
      "description": "Standard Go runtime metric. Tracks in-flight work. Healthy: stable. Climbing without bound: a goroutine leak.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Waiting for first scrape..."
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "expr": "go_goroutines{job=~\"victoriametrics|vmagent|vmalert\"}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scrape health (vmagent's view)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "vm-llm-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 18
      },
      "description": "vmagent emits up=1 for each successful scrape, up=0 on failure. If a row is missing, the target is not in prometheus.yml.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=~\"victoriametrics|vmagent|vmalert|llm-simulator\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Top noisy labels (manual exploration)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "id": 400
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cardinality drill-down",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Live cardinality stats**\n\n- [vmui Cardinality](http://localhost:8428/vmui/#/?tab=cardinality) -- top labels, top metrics, top label-value pairs\n- [tsdb status JSON](http://localhost:8428/api/v1/status/tsdb)\n\n**Discover what self-metrics VM exposes**\n```\n# What duration / request / http metrics does THIS VM version expose?\ndocker exec vm-llm wget -qO- http://localhost:8428/metrics \\\n    | grep -E '^vm_(request|http|duration)|duration_seconds' \\\n    | grep -v '^#' | head -20\n```\n\n**Universal fallback metrics (always exposed by Go services)**\n- `process_cpu_seconds_total` (counter)\n- `process_resident_memory_bytes` (gauge)\n- `go_goroutines` (gauge -- concurrency proxy)\n- `go_memstats_alloc_bytes` (gauge -- allocator pressure)\n- `up{job=...}` (synthetic, vmagent-emitted)"
      }
    }
  ]
}